            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Mose 0.1.40

**New**
- Trackpad gestures per app, like the mouse's buttons: add an app at the top right of the trackpad page and give it gestures of its own. They take over while that app is in front.
- “N gestures set up” under the trackpad's name lists every gesture, global and per app; click one to edit it.

**Improved**
- The trackpad page is centred and quieter: the list beside it is gone, and the trackpad moves aside only while a gesture is being edited.
- Drawing your fingers on the trackpad is now off by default. Turn it on with Show fingers in the bottom bar.

Requires macOS 15 or later.
]]></description>
