        <item>
            <title>0.1.37</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 21:44:59 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/linmi/mose/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>38</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.37</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Mose 0.1.37

**New**
- Trackpad gestures. Open Trackpad in the sidebar and give Mose actions to three-, four- and five-finger taps, the four corners, hold-and-tap, three- and four-finger clicks, swipes and five-finger pinches. Gestures System Settings already uses are left to macOS and marked as such. A light haptic tap on the trackpad confirms each gesture, and taps while typing or with a palm resting are ignored.
- The trackpad has its own page: drawn to scale, it shows your fingers live, and you can feel each of its haptic waveforms. The built-in trackpad shows your Mac's picture; a Magic Trackpad shows its own, with its battery.
- Usage Stats count the trackpad too, and each mouse on its own. Choose which devices to include from the menu at the top.

Requires macOS 15 or later.
]]></description>
